span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">학부과정</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">교환학생</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">들의 생활 정착에서부터 학사 및 교내외 활동에 이르는 전반적인 부분에 대한 도움을 제공</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">재학생과 외국인 학생간의 상호교류를 활성화시킴으로써 글로벌 리더로서의 소양을 기르고자 구성된 프로그램</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">1. </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">지원 자격</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; 가</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">본교에서 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">1</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">학기 이상 수학한 재학생</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; 나</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">책임감이 강하고 적극적이며 사교적인 학생</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; 다</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">봉사정신이 강하고 유학생들과의 교류를 희망하는 학생</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; 라</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">외국어 가능자 혹은 외국어 습득에 열의가 있는 학생</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ;